</div>
</div>

<div class="space-y-1">
<p class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm italic text-secondary tracking-wide">
          Shahrear Ahamed
        </p>
<h1 class="font-display-hero text-display-hero text-on-surface leading-tight tracking-tight">I build <span class="line-through decoration-outline/60 text-outline-variant font-normal italic">features</span><br /><span class="font-normal tracking-tight">systems that scale.</span></h1>
</div>

<p id="about" class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-[540px] mx-auto leading-relaxed pt-space-xs">
        Ten years building software that holds up — <strong class="font-medium text-on-surface">scalable systems</strong>, workflows that cut friction, and <strong class="font-medium text-on-surface">teams that own what they build</strong>. Lately I work at the <strong class="font-medium text-on-surface">AI-native</strong> end: engineering products where the model is the substance, not a sprinkle.
      </p>

<div class="flex justify-center items-center gap-3 pt-space-xs text-on-surface-variant">
<a aria-label="GitHub" class="p-1.5 hover:text-primary transition-colors active:scale-[0.98]" href="https://github.com/shahrear-ahamed">
<svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0024 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z"></path></svg>
</a>
<a aria-label="X / Twitter" class="p-1.5 hover:text-primary transition-colors active:scale-[0.98]" href="https://x.com">
<svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"></path></svg>
