</a>
<a aria-label="Email" class="p-1.5 hover:text-primary transition-colors active:scale-[0.98]" href="mailto:contact@shahrear.dev">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[17px]">mail</span>
</a>
</div>

<div class="pt-space-md border-t border-outline-variant/30 max-w-[460px] mx-auto space-y-3">
<div class="space-y-1">
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface font-medium">
            Curated engineering notes, straight to your inbox.
          </p>
<p class="font-label-mono text-label-mono text-secondary">
            An occasional dispatch. Thoughtfully written.
          </p>
</div>
<p id="newsletter-status" role="status" class="font-label-mono text-label-mono"></p><form class="flex items-center gap-1.5 p-1 bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/70 rounded-full focus-within:border-primary transition-colors wobbly-pill" id="newsletter-form">
<div class="pl-3 pr-1 text-on-surface-variant flex items-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">alternate_email</span>
</div>
<input class="w-full bg-transparent border-none text-body-sm font-body-sm text-on-surface placeholder:text-outline-variant focus:ring-0 focus:outline-none py-1 px-1" aria-label="Email address" placeholder="Enter your email" required="" type="email" />
<button class="px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary-container text-on-primary font-nav-link text-nav-link hover:opacity-90 active:scale-[0.98] transition-all shrink-0" type="submit">
            Subscribe
          </button>
</form>
<p class="font-label-mono text-label-mono text-on-surface-variant/80 tracking-normal">
          Newsletter coming soon. Your email is not collected yet.
        </p>
</div>
</section>

<div class="w-full my-space-lg hand-wavy-stroke overflow-hidden"><svg class="w-full h-2 stroke-current" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 0 1200 6" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M0 3.2 Q 80 1.8, 160 3.4 T 320 2.6 T 480 3.5 T 640 2.5 T 800 3.4 T 960 2.7 T 1120 3.3 T 1200 2.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.2"></path></svg></div><section class="space-y-space-sm pt-space-xs" id="experience">
<h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface">Work experience</h2>
<div class="space-y-space-sm">
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Ten years across product companies — from distributed PHP &amp; Go applications at East West Media and IPvision, through Pathao’s core ride-sharing services, to senior engineering at MyZenTeam, Kaz360, and Kahf Yazılım, designing systems that carry real scale.
        </p>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface">
          I'm currently <strong class="font-medium text-primary">open to new opportunities and consultations</strong> —
          <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-medium underline underline-offset-4 decoration-outline-variant hover:decoration-primary transition-colors" href="mailto:contact@shahrear.dev">
            get in touch <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[15px]">mail</span>
</a>.
        </p>
<div>
<a class="font-label-mono text-label-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary hover:text-primary flex items-center gap-1 pt-1 group" href="#experience">
<span class="">FULL STORY</span>
<span class="group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform">→</span>
</a>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<div class="w-full my-space-lg hand-wavy-stroke overflow-hidden"><svg class="w-full h-2 stroke-current" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 0 1200 6" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M0 2.8 Q 90 3.8, 180 2.7 T 360 3.4 T 540 2.5 T 720 3.5 T 900 2.6 T 1080 3.3 T 1200 2.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.2"></path></svg></div>

