</div><div class="hidden md:block absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-1/2 -ml-px w-2.5 hand-wavy-stroke pointer-events-none overflow-hidden"><svg class="w-2 h-full stroke-current" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 0 6 800" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M3 0 Q 1.8 50, 3.2 100 T 2.7 200 T 3.3 300 T 2.6 400 T 3.3 500 T 2.7 600 T 3.2 700 T 2.9 800" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.2"></path></svg></div>

